---
---
<section class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto py-32 px-4 relative z-10">
  <div 
    class="bg-gray-900 rounded-[2rem] p-12 md:p-20 text-center relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl"
    data-animate="fade-up"
  >
    <!-- Background glows -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] bg-primary/20 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none opacity-50"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-blue-500/10 blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none opacity-40"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Lleva tu práctica legal al siguiente nivel.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Únete a los estudios jurídicos líderes que ya están utilizando Argemus para ganar más casos en menos tiempo.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
        <button class="bg-white text-gray-900 font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto shadow-lg shadow-white/10 hover:shadow-white/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 duration-300">
          Comenzar prueba gratuita
        </button>
        <button class="bg-white/10 text-white backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 font-medium px-8 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-white/20 transition-all w-full sm:w-auto hover:-translate-y-0.5 duration-300">
          Hablar con ventas
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
